    <tr><td class="col-num">2<td><code>incomeId</code><td class="col-req">Required<td>Integer<td class="long">Sequence number of the income, starting with 1 (KaFE's own ErtragId). Also serves, together with creditorId, as the linking key referenced by the '5 Investment Chain' and '6 Transaction Data' sheets.</tr>
