    <tr><td class="col-num">10<td><code>SubstantialHolding/HoldingPeriod12M</code><td class="col-req">Optional<td>Enum (<a href="#enum-boolean">Boolean</a>): <code>true</code>, <code>false</code><td class="long">Has the investment been held for a period of at least one year?</tr>
