    <tr><td class="col-num">13<td><code>CreditorJur/General_Data/TinAvailable</code><td class="col-req">Required<td>Enum (<a href="#enum-boolean">Boolean</a>): <code>true</code>, <code>false</code><td class="long">Does the person with limited tax liability have a foreign tax identification number?</tr>
    <tr><td class="col-num">14<td><code>CreditorJur/General_Data/IDNumber_CountryOfResidence</code><td class="col-req">Optional<td>Text (max 40)<td class="long">Foreign tax identification number</tr>
