    <tr><td class="col-num">36<td><code>CreditorJur/German_TaxOffice/German_TaxOffice</code><td class="col-req">Optional<td>Enum (<a href="#enum-boolean">Boolean</a>): <code>true</code>, <code>false</code><td class="long">Is the person with limited tax liability registered with a German tax office?</tr>
    <tr><td class="col-num">37<td><code>CreditorJur/German_TaxOffice/TaxNumber</code><td class="col-req">Optional<td>Text (max 13)<td class="long">Tax number (13 digits)</tr>
