    <tr><td class="col-num">39<td><code>CreditorJur/OptingUnderCorpTaxAct/TaxAuthority</code><td class="col-req">Optional<td>Enum (<a href="#enum-steuerbehoerden">Steuerbehoerden</a>): <code>FA</code>, <code>BZST</code><td class="long">Tax authority</tr>
